<title>UK: Frankfurter Hypo sets 100 mln mark REX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Frankfurter Hypo sets 100 mln mark REX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANKFURTER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.50	MATURITY    17.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING    FFURT     GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST YEAR THEN COUPON LINKED TO THE REX 10-YEAR</p>
<p>		YIELD SUB INDEX.</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 717.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
